  "body": "As mentioned here:\n\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/html5/infrastructure.html#boolean-attribute\n\nWe should not allow to set any value to the boolean attribute except empty string and case insensitive attribute name itself. But I see that we don't have any way to check if this constraint is respected by the browser. \n",
